{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "I changed migrate.sh last week and ./verify.sh has been failing ever since.\nFix migrate.sh so `bash verify.sh` passes."}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "03ca6deab18d7c99", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to run: ls -la && echo '--- migrate.sh ---' && sed -n '1,240p' migrate.sh && echo '--- verify.sh ---' && sed -n '1,260p' verify.sh && echo '--- git diff ---' && git diff -- migrate.sh verify.sh; bash verify.sh", "turn_key": "sha256:964db78b43324b91263369609b717405"}
